{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg2kxLEnN9yR8sMjTNmfN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J2jFxS1K3vo6G18iUczifw","name":"mcp__knewat__add_source","input":{"agent_id":"researcher","title":"Acme Notes API: product brief","kind":"doc","uri":"acme-docs/01_product_brief.md","trust":1,"text":"# Acme Notes API: product brief\n\nAcme Notes is a small notes service for the fictional company Acme Corp. Teams create notes, tag them, and\nsearch them by tag or text. The first release is a REST API only (no UI).\n\n- Goal: a notes REST service ready for internal pilot in six weeks.\n- Scope: create, read, update, delete and list notes; tags; full-text search is a later phase.\n- Owner: the Acme Platform team.\n- Rate limit: 100 requests per minute per client."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":487,"cache_read_input_tokens":18939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":487},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f216a67a-acac-4c74-9896-ab8fd191cfac","uuid":"5a2b99ab-7a5d-41dd-89b9-f742f8cfdbe6","timestamp":"2026-10-14T20:26:56.369Z","request_id":"req_011Cg2kxL19831wVL5ynGLky","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01J2jFxS1K3vo6G18iUczifw":{"agent_id":"researcher","title":"Acme Notes API: product brief","kind":"doc","uri":"acme-docs/01_product_brief.md","trust":1,"text":"# Acme Notes API: product brief\n\nAcme Notes is a small notes service for the fictional company Acme Corp. Teams create notes, tag them, and\nsearch them by tag or text. The first release is a REST API only (no UI).\n\n- Goal: a notes REST service ready for internal pilot in six weeks.\n- Scope: create, read, update, delete and list note